[en.IDEA_C08_MANEHATTAN_THE_CALLING]
Revolt of the Slaves

[en.IDEA_C08_MANEHATTAN_THE_CALLING_desc]
It seems the ponies don’t like the jobs we assigned them... We were doing them a favor, giving each of them a job! How could they treat our kindness like this!

Wait, it seems that there are some... impostors in the crowd...

[zh.IDEA_C08_MANEHATTAN_THE_CALLING]
奴隶暴动

[zh.IDEA_C08_MANEHATTAN_THE_CALLING_desc]
看起来小马们不太爱我们分配的工作... 我们可是在做好事，给了你们每只小马一个工作！你们竟然这样对待我们的一片好心！

等等，普通小马的队伍中似乎混进了...
